1.Log in to Jira and create a new Scrum project named My Team.
2. Open the Summary section to view project details and progress.
3. Create tasks in the Backlog and organize them into a sprint.
4. Start the sprint and track tasks using the Board.
5. View task schedules using Timeline and explore the List/work-item view
